Hina's Drift Club gives the 190E Evo II a virtual naturally aspirated torque build. Strong, broad delivery and a progressive pedal make it the club's torque king. Its native body, sound, damage, customization and five-speed manual remain. Hina's Drifters 190E tyres, a mechanical LSD and increased steering travel reward smooth inputs and earlier catches. This is an authored drift setup, not a reproduction of the factory M102 engine.
